# Allowlist for Dockerfile.cmd, the only docker build left (the
# hub image is nix-built, fly/image.nix, since talos-config-e8d; the
# gateway likewise, k8s/apps/gateway/image.nix): the server module and
# the sibling modules its go.mod replaces by relative path. Of the iroh
# modules only go.mod (+ go.sum where one exists) are needed — the module graph must load,
# nothing from them is compiled into the bridge.
*
!config-server
!protocol
!iroh-transport/go.mod
!iroh-transport/go.sum
!iroh-go/go.mod

# Build output and docs that sit in the working tree.
config-server/config-server
config-server/result
protocol/docs
